      "writtenOn": "2026-07-17T13:18:23Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "I understand why we\u0027re removing the build check, but I\u0027m not sure why `isUpdatedDisplayConnectionDialogEnabled()` is also being removed",
      "parentUuid": "7dd57522_a6c0dea8",
      "revId": "45034f0663f960d9ee5fb0a101a4732b71f6e2f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
