      "message": "Thanks for the clarification, Piotr!\nThe only changes from the original are:\n1) Removed Build.IS_ENG || Build.IS_USERDEBUG gate so the sysprop works on user builds\n2) Added isEnabledInLayoutLocked as a standalone check for statically configured displays",
