      "writtenOn": "2026-07-22T11:15:24Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Yes, I agree, this was added only for testing or validate compliance with DisplayPort, as their test setup requires the display to auto-connect. We should not remove that here.\n\nI also agree the rest of the CL looks good.",
      "parentUuid": "78360ff0_ff226e75",
