      "writtenOn": "2026-07-22T13:41:37Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "If you want OEMs to set that value, I would rather you create a new config overlay for it. The OEMs could then set that value to true for devices that need to enable on connect, the default being false.\n\nNow, checking another option, I am surprised you even need this: Android Auto should auto-enable external displays already, due to [packages/apps/Car/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/car/displayconfig/ExternalDisplayController.kt](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/android-latest-release:packages/apps/Car/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/car/displayconfig/ExternalDisplayController.kt;l\u003d1?q\u003dpackages%2Fapps%2FCar%2FSystemUI%2Fsrc%2Fcom%2Fandroid%2Fsystemui%2Fcar%2Fdisplayconfig%2FExternalDisplayController.kt\u0026sq\u003d). Isn\u0027t this working for you already?",
      "parentUuid": "b93399e3_9aebd840",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 288,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 288,
        "endChar": 48
      },
      "revId": "45034f0663f960d9ee5fb0a101a4732b71f6e2f4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
