      "message": "As this is a very small change, I would encourage you to simply update this CL. We can review that. And yes, with the config overlay, this would be also for user builds. TL;DR: you simply add something like `if (context.getResources().getBoolean(R.bool.config_external_display_auto_enable, false)) { return true; }` to the function that would otherwise stay the same.",
